<title>USA: Applied Cell unit gets distributor deal.</title>
<headline>Applied Cell unit gets distributor deal.</headline>
<dateline>NIXA, Mo. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Cellular Technology Inc said Wednesday its wholly owned subsidiary MVAK Technologies Inc was named the exclusive distributor for WooSung Vacuum Pumps in the United States.</p>
<p>MVAK said it expects the agreement to contribute more than $500,000 in annual sales, a 14 percent increase from 1997 estimated sales of $3.5 million.</p>
<p>Applied Cellular is a specialty telecommunications and high-technology company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
